nnot prove correctness for every theoretically valid email or auth_token syntax, though the implementation was inspected and exercised against the seeded logs and a varied format matrix.","The lifecycle temporary-file inventory covers /tmp, not /var/tmp; consequently it does not independently inventory the retained /var/tmp artifacts, although their creation and continued use are directly shown in executor commands."]}
